摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Pilot Harness — a CodePilot-inspired desktop client and plugin suite for DeepSeek Harness on macOS, Windows, and Linux.","id":"gh:1336793734","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"pilot-harness","slug":"op7418/pilot-harness","topics":["ai-agent","codepilot","deepseek","deepseek-harness","desktop-app","dsh","dsh-plugin","electron","linux","macos","typescript","windows"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Pilot Harness — a CodePilot-inspired desktop client and plugin suite for DeepSeek Harness on macOS, "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"odePilot-inspired desktop client and plugin suite for DeepSeek Harness on macOS, Windows, and Linux."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Pilot Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A CodePilot-inspired desktop client and plugin suite for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Run the DeepSeek Harness plugin runtime as a focused native app, manage providers and multimodal mod"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"els visually, and keep desktop additions isolated as ordinary Harness plugins."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Quick start ·\nPlugins ·\nArchitecture ·\nMIT License"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why Pilot Harness"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness has a powerful “everything is a plugin” architecture, but its default experience is"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" designed around a CLI-launched Web UI. Pilot Harness keeps that runtime model and adds the parts ex"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"pected from a daily desktop product:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **A real desktop app** — Electron packages the local Harness runtime for macOS, Windows, and Linux"},{"id":"p9s2","text":", owns native window behavior, and provides a recovery screen when startup needs attention.\n- **A ca"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"lmer CodePilot-inspired interface** — consistent tokens, radii, menus, hover states, settings cards,"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" Markdown, conversation/trajectory navigation, and platform-aware title bars.\n- **Provider and model"},{"id":"p9s5","text":" management** — connect supported providers, declare an OpenAI-compatible endpoint, manage credentia"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ls separately from settings, browse the live model catalog, and identify image-capable models.\n- **W"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"orkspace context without clutter** — project-aware conversation rows show branch, state, reminder su"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"mmary, mode, and model details, while Files opens as a true right sidebar.\n- **Plugin-first extensio"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"ns** — the theme, Worktree sidebar, Schedule summary, and Session-log export remain Cordis/DeepSeek "},{"id":"p9s10","text":"Harness rows rather than desktop-only business logic.\n- **Reversible customization** — disabling the"},{"id":"p9s11","text":" CodePilot theme row removes its product mark and visual overrides so the stock Harness presentation"},{"id":"p9s12","text":" can take over again."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Pilot Harness does not replace the DeepSeek Harness agent loop, Session log, tool pipeline, provider"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" contracts, or RPC implementation. Electron owns packaging and native integration; the composed Harn"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ess plugin tree remains the application runtime."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Download Pilot Harness"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Download the installer for your system from GitHub Releases:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Platform | Download | Install and handle the security prompt |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| **macOS (Apple Silicon)** | DMG installer\nZIP app | Open the DMG, drag `pilot-harness.app` into **"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"Applications**, and launch it normally. A formal Release is published only after its Developer ID si"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"gnature has been verified. Because notarization is not enabled yet, Gatekeeper may still block the f"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"irst launch; in that case open **System Settings → Privacy & Security**, click **Open Anyway**, then"},{"id":"p15s5","text":" confirm **Open**. Do not run `xattr` or disable Gatekeeper for a formal Release. If macOS reports t"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"hat the signed app is damaged, delete it, verify the Release checksum, and download it again instead"},{"id":"p15s7","text":" of bypassing the warning. Apple's security instructions. |\n| **Windows (x64)** | EXE installer | Ru"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"n the EXE. If Microsoft Defender SmartScreen says **Windows protected your PC**, first confirm that "},{"id":"p15s9","text":"the file came from this Release, then choose **More info → Run anyway**. Do not disable SmartScreen "},{"id":"p15s10","text":"globally. A managed computer may hide this option; contact its administrator instead. Microsoft's Sm"},{"id":"p15s11","text":"artScreen explanation. |\n| **Linux (x64)** | AppImage\nDEB\nRPM | DEB: sudo apt install ./Pilot-Harnes"},{"id":"p15s12","text":"s-Linux-amd64.deb\nRPM: sudo dnf install ./Pilot-Harness-Linux-x86_64.rpm\nAppImage: chmod +x Pilot-Ha"},{"id":"p15s13","text":"rness-Linux-x86_64.AppImage, then ./Pilot-Harness-Linux-x86_64.AppImage. If the file manager blocks "},{"id":"p15s14","text":"execution, enable **Allow executing file as program** in file properties. The preview packages are u"},{"id":"p15s15","text":"nsigned, so only accept a package-manager warning after confirming the official Release source. |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## What is included"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Area | What Pilot Harness adds | Ownership |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Desktop shell | Native window, local runtime lifecycle, directory dialog, recovery, installers, an"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"d platform icons | Electron app |\n| Visual system | CodePilot-inspired design tokens and component c"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ontracts | @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-codepilot-theme |\n| Workspace Files | Right sidebar, file coun"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"t, branch summary, row actions, and @path insertion | @deepseek-ai/dsh-ui-worktree |\n| Reminder summ"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"ary | Active reminder count and nearest scheduled time in Session hover details | @deepseek-ai/dsh-u"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"i-schedule-summary |\n| Session export | Per-Session ZIP export from the Trajectory toolbar and /expo"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"rt | @deepseek-ai/dsh-session-log-export |\n| Providers and models | Configurable adapter, credential"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"/settings UI, live catalog, and multimodal labels | Existing Harness plugins plus the Pilot Harness "},{"id":"p19s9","text":"e catalog, and multimodal labels | Existing Harness plugins plus the Pilot Harness desktop profile |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The provider/model experience is deliberately a **profile composition**, not a new provider implemen"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"tation. It mounts existing adapter, Settings, and Credentials contracts, then replaces the desktop p"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"laceholder only after a real provider advertises a usable model."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Use the plugins independently"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The desktop client already includes every plugin below. If you use a local DeepSeek Harness Web prof"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ile instead, install only the feature you want with one command; each release asset is a prebuilt ds"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"h.bundle, so no repository clone, YAML patch, or local build is required."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### CodePilot theme"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Applies the Pilot Harness visual system and product mark. Removing the plugin restores the stock Har"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ness presentation. See theme details."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Files sidebar"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Adds the Workspace-confined right file sidebar, file count, branch summary, row actions, and @path i"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"nsertion. See Files plugin details."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Reminder summary"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Adds active-reminder metadata to Session hover details while the upstream Schedule plugin remains th"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"e reminder authority. See reminder plugin details."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Session-log export"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Adds per-Session ZIP export to the **Trajectory** toolbar and the /export command. See export plugin"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"Session ZIP export to the **Trajectory** toolbar and the /export command. See export plugin details."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
